---
/**
 * Terms of use (App_Flow §A.1; PRD Rules 11, 12, 15). LegalLayout, no ads.
 *
 * LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED before launch (Engineering_Plan: agent audit items). Open items
 * for the reviewer: the operator's legal name and address, the governing law and courts
 * (left out on purpose until the operator's location is known), and the limit on
 * liability, which depends on local consumer law. Also set PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL.
 */
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';

const description =
  'The terms for using Beautally: what the estimates are, what you agree to, and the limits of what we can promise.';
const { contactEmail } = SITE;
---

<LegalLayout title="Terms of use" description={description} path="/terms/" updated="2026-11-15">
  <p class="text-lg">
    These terms cover your use of Beautally. By using the site you agree to them. If you do not
    agree, please do not use it.
  </p>

  <h2>What Beautally is</h2>
  <p>
    Beautally is a free tool that estimates how much paint, flooring, tile and wallpaper a home
    project may need. It runs in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Estimates only</h2>
  <p>
    Every result is an estimate. It is based on the sizes you enter and on common coverage and
    waste figures. Real needs depend on your surfaces, your tools, your skill and the product you
    choose.
  </p>
  <p>
    You are responsible for checking the label on each product and for deciding how much to buy.
    Read our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> as part of these terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>You agree to use Beautally lawfully and fairly. Please do not:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Try to break, overload or gain unauthorised access to the site.</li>
    <li>Copy the site's content in bulk, or sell it, without our written permission.</li>
    <li>Use the site in a way that breaks the law or harms other people.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your data</h2>
  <p>
    Your rooms are saved on your own device and are not sent to us. You are responsible for your
    device and browser. If you clear your browser data, your saved rooms are removed. The
    <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> has the details.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, guides, design and code of Beautally belong to us or our licensors. You may use the
    site and print your own shopping lists for personal use. Please do not republish our content
    as your own.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising, shops and other websites</h2>
  <p>
    The site may show advertising and links to shops and other websites. We do not control those
    sites and are not responsible for them. Their own terms and privacy policies apply.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some links may be affiliate links. Prices, stock and product details are set by the shop, not
    by us.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep Beautally accurate and available. We provide it as it is, and we cannot promise
    that it is free of errors or always online.
  </p>

  <h2>Limits on our responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, we are not responsible for the cost of materials you buy. That
    includes shortfalls, surpluses and any other loss that comes from relying on an estimate.
  </p>
  <p>Nothing in these terms limits any right you have by law that cannot be limited.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may change the site or these terms. When we change the terms we will update the date at the
    top of this page. If you keep using Beautally after that, you accept the new terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Write to us at
    {
      contactEmail ? (
        <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
      ) : (
        <span>[contact address to be added before launch]</span>
      )
    }.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
